    "title": "Invocation manifest for MRtrix3: Preprocessing Pipeline"
  },
  "description": "The preprocessing pipeline will be run with the following seven input files: the diffusion\u2011weighted image (DIFF) in NIfTI format, the anatomical T1\u2011weighted image (ANAT) also in NIfTI, the gradient\u2011direction vector file (BVEC) as a bvec, the corresponding b\u2011value list (BVAL) as a bval, plus the reverse\u2011phase\u2011encoded counterparts \u2013 the reverse diffusion image (RDIF) in NIfTI, the reverse b\u2011value list (RBVL) as a bval, and the reverse b\u2011vector file (RBVC) as a bvec.\n\nAll processing steps are enabled except for optional reslicing: Gibbs ringing removal (degibbs) is turned on, denoising (denoise) and bias\u2011field correction (bias) are active, and both eddy\u2011current/motion correction (eddy) and Rician noise correction (ricn) are applied. No phase\u2011encoding reversal is requested (rpe = none). The pipeline will not perform AC\u2011PC alignment (acpc = false) but will use a phase\u2011encoding direction of PA (acqd = \u201cPA\u201d). Resampling is set to a voxel size of 1.0\u202fmm (reslice = 1.0), while the optional reslicing step is disabled (doreslice = false). Validation will use 1000 points (nval = 1000), and intensity normalization is not applied (norm = false).",
  "reference_json": {
    "inputs": {
      "BVEC": {
        "type": "bvec"
      },
      "DIFF": {
        "type": "nifti"
      },
      "BVAL": {
        "type": "bval"
      },
      "ANAT": {
        "type": "nifti"
      },
      "RBVL": {
        "type": "bval"
      },
      "RBVC": {
        "type": "bvec"
      },
      "RDIF": {
        "type": "nifti"
      }
    },
    "config": {
      "degibbs": true,
      "doreslice": false,
      "denoise": true,
      "acpc": false,
      "ricn": true,
      "eddy": true,
      "bias": true,
      "rpe": "none",
      "nval": 1000,
      "acqd": "PA",
      "norm": false,
      "reslice": 1.0
    }
  }
